<div class="container py-5">
  <h1 class="mb-4">Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p class="text-secondary">
    At AASRA, we value your privacy. We collect and use personal data solely to improve your experience, process adoptions, and support rescue operations. We never sell or share your data with third parties without your consent.
  </p>

  <h5 class="mt-4">Information We Collect</h5>
  <ul class="text-secondary">
    <li>Email addresses during registration</li>
    <li>Contact info when volunteering or donating</li>
    <li>Location data for rescue requests (with permission)</li>
  </ul>

  <h5 class="mt-4">How We Use It</h5>
  <p class="text-secondary">
    The data is used for matching adopters with animals, coordinating rescue logistics, and sending relevant updates or event info. You can opt out anytime.
  </p>

  <h5 class="mt-4">Security</h5>
  <p class="text-secondary">
    We implement industry-standard security to protect your data. However, no method of transmission over the Internet is 100% secure.
  </p>

  <p class="text-muted mt-4">
    Last updated: <%= Date.today.strftime("%B %d, %Y") %>
  </p>
</div>
